            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "You can, and it is efficient on floors and shower walls. Most impregnating stone sealers also work on cement grout, and grout is often the more absorbent of the two. Check that the product is rated for both, and look at our grout sealer guide if the grout needs a dedicated product."
          }
